{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108415","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108415/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108415/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108415/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108415","id":3213297459,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6d_Lt1","number":108415,"title":"Support defining unit tests in their own .cpp files","user":{"login":"simpkins","id":163549,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzU0OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163549?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins","html_url":"https://github.com/simpkins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2231593685,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjMxNTkzNjg1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:tests","name":"topic:tests","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-07-08T17:38:51Z","updated_at":"2026-02-19T15:57:17Z","closed_at":"2026-02-19T15:57:09Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108415","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108415","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108415.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108415.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"All unit tests are currently compiled as part of `test_main.cpp`, which includes nearly 150 separate test header files.  This makes this file take a very long time to compile: over 50 seconds to compile on an AMD 7800X3D, and over 6 minutes to compile on an older Intel Core i7-4790K. This makes the edit-compile-test cycle rather painful when working on test code.  Splitting the tests into separate .cpp files allows them to be compiled in parallel, and allows recompiling just set of tests you care about when iterating on a specific test.\r\n\r\nThis commit updates the SConstruct and tests/SCsub files to link the unit test library with `-Wl,--whole-archive` or `/WHOLEARCHIVE`.  These flags allow unit test to be defined in their own separate `.cpp` files, instead of having to define all tests in `test_main.cpp`.\r\n\r\nThe `-Wl,--whole-archive` flag is necessary to ensure that the linker always includes the other `.cpp` files that define test cases. `test_main.cpp` gets included because `main/main.cpp` calls its `test_main()` function.  However, as far as the linker is concerned the editor does not directly reference functions in other test .cpp files, so it would omit them from the linked binary without this flag. The other .cpp files define constructor functions that should run before `main()` to register their tests, but unfortunately these constructor functions aren't sufficient to make the linker know that these files are required in the final binary.\r\n\r\nI converted test_arraymesh.cpp just as a proof-of-concept.  The other test header files can be converted in the future if desired.\r\n\r\nThis was discussed somewhat in godotengine/godot-proposals#11654","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108415/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":3},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108415/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}